  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-handmade-sterling-silver-kingman-turquoise-earrings-southwest-dangle-jewe', '1857466948', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1857466948/navajo-handmade-sterling-silver-kingman?click_key=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%3ALTbabad6cbb7d039b539444f6ac03b02a4e8992db4&click_sum=3f4db5b6&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-487527-16-42&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%253ALTbabad6cbb7d039b539444f6ac03b02a4e8992db4',
   'Navajo Handmade Sterling Silver Kingman Turquoise Earrings – Southwest Dangle Jewelry, Native American Made, Indigenous Made', 'Experience the beauty of authentic Navajo craftsmanship with these stunning handmade sterling silver hoop earrings, featuring genuine Kingman turquoise. Each earring is meticulously handcrafted by skilled Navajo artisans, showcasing intricate silverwork and high-quality turquoise stones, making them a timeless statement piece. ✨ Why You''ll Love These Earrings: ✔ Authentic Navajo handcrafted jewelry – one-of-a-kind artisan design ✔ Genuine Kingman turquoise – sourced from Arizona’s renowned Kingman mine ✔ Timeless Southwest style – ideal for lovers of Native American and Western jewelry ✔ Perfect gift – a meaningful and elegant choice for turquoise lovers Each piece is handmade, so slight design variations may occur. We strive for your satisfaction and will gladly custom-make a replacement if needed.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
