  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'kayenta-metal-stamp-southwest-design', '1245819051', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1245819051/kayenta-metal-stamp-southwest-design?click_key=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%3ALTb17c77f3adf9398b3ce61616c40d3224b29194ad&click_sum=8c351ba5&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-487527-16-40&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1&content_source=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%253ALTb17c77f3adf9398b3ce61616c40d3224b29194ad',
   'Kayenta Metal Stamp - Southwest Design', 'Kayenta Metal Stamps buy individually or save some money & buy a Set (which includes 3mm, 5mm & 7mm & 10mm . These metal stamps are made of heat-treated, high-carbon steel. These sweet deep stamps work perfectly with our concho kits that we also make! They feature a logo mark indexed at the design''s 6 o''clock position to help you properly orient the design to your workpiece. Our stamps are always made to create a deep, bold impression. All of our stamps are made in-house to ensure their quality & Tested by Blondie. Choose the 5mm size for compatibility with our 1.5" concho kits. Choose the 3mm size for compatibility with our 1" concho kits. NOTE: Size refers to the MAJOR dimension. For tall designs it refers to the height. For wide designs it refers to the width.', 'accessories',
