  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'hubei-turquoise-triple-appliqu-d-post-earrings', '4602558108', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4602558108/hubei-turquoise-triple-appliqued-post?click_key=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%3ALTb732329e4bd86723f21604b8982d22ee79be7502&click_sum=4492ebf2&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-487527-16-28&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=bf4a0812-0b60-4295-a583-07ea0206968e%253ALTb732329e4bd86723f21604b8982d22ee79be7502',
   'Hubei Turquoise Triple Appliquéd Post Earrings', 'Who says triangles and circles can''t get along? These delightful Hubei turquoise post earrings prove otherwise! Beautiful mint-green Hubei turquoise, dramatically streaked with coal-black spiderweb matrix and mother rock, creates an eye-catching contrast in these wonderfully distinctive earrings. The triangular cabochons come from an earlier generation of fine Hubei turquoise, when some truly exceptional material was finding its way into the hands of American lapidaries and jewelers. Master Navajo silversmith Geneva Ramone created these sterling silver earrings in 2026, surrounding each triangular stone with three beautifully stamped silver appliqués. The resulting design has an almost round, button-like silhouette that makes the sharp geometry of the turquoise stand out even more. Tiny stamped silver accents complete the look. The posts and nuts are sterling silver. The earrings measure 1 inch high by 7/8 inch wide, giving them a surprisingly substantial appearance without the weight. At just 9.8 grams for the pair, or 4.9 grams per earring, they''re comfortably light for all-day wear. Bold black matrix, refreshing mint-green color, and imaginative Navajo silverwork make these little beauties impossible to overlook. Production partners TAMStarDesigns makes this item with help from Geneva Ramone, Albuquerque, NM', 'turquoise-jewelry',
