  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'antique-navajo-turquoise-ring-925-sterling-silver-southwestern-native-american-b', '4566484570', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4566484570/antique-navajo-turquoise-ring-925?click_key=EuJgNAiy871arif8sV1dFEH80b97%3ALT380a701bc520319a594e453a69d5f358c6533833&click_sum=149f215c&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-222806-12-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1',
   'Antique Navajo Turquoise Ring, 925 Sterling Silver, Southwestern Native American Boho Jewelry', 'Antique Navajo Turquoise 925 Sterling Silver Ring Add a bold Southwestern touch to your jewelry collection with this Antique Navajo Turquoise Ring, handcrafted in 925 Sterling Silver. Featuring a beautiful natural turquoise gemstone with distinctive matrix patterns and an antique-style silver setting, this statement ring offers a timeless Western and Boho look. Product Details Stone: Navajo Turquoise Stone Size: 10 × 17 mm Metal: 925 Sterling Silver Style: Antique, Southwestern, Western, Boho Stone Shape: Elongated / Freeform Finish: Handcrafted with Antique Silver Finish Ring: Made to order according to the selected size Unique Turquoise Gemstone The turquoise stone showcases beautiful natural color variations and matrix patterns, giving the ring an authentic gemstone character. No two natural turquoise stones are exactly alike, making every ring unique and special. Perfect For Turquoise jewelry collectors Southwestern jewelry lovers Western and Boho fashion Statement ring lovers 925 sterling silver jewelry enthusiasts Everyday unique gemstone styling Great Gift Choice A beautiful gift for birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, Father''s Day, Mother''s Day, or anyone who appreciates turquoise, handmade silver jewelry, and Southwestern style. Please Note Natural turquoise may have variations in color, matrix, texture, and markings. These differences are natural characteristics of the gemstone and make each ring one of a kind. The actual stone may vary slightly from the photos. Each piece is carefully handcrafted in 925 Sterling Silver, with attention to detail and quality, creating a unique antique-inspired turquoise ring designed to be enjoyed for years.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
