  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-handmade-3-strand-necklace-sand-cast-style-naja-pendant-german-silv', '4474747114', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4474747114/navajo-pearl-handmade-3-strand-necklace?click_key=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%3ALT8c9afc26b3ad21a37ba3ed481bd5d8221a668d09&click_sum=84ec3c44&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23164-11-45&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%253ALT8c9afc26b3ad21a37ba3ed481bd5d8221a668d09',
   'Navajo Pearl Handmade 3 Strand Necklace & Sand-Cast Style Naja Pendant ~ German Silver beads ~ Adjustable Length!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! Stunning Western Navajo Pearl & Turquoise Necklace. Pearls are 5, 6 & 8mm beads Turquoise Beads are 5mm This adjustable design is strung on high-quality leather. The Sterling Silver slider bead allows for fully custom sizing- fits any neck size! Beaded strands are approximately 14.75", 16.5", and 18" long. DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two desert pearls are exactly alike! See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
